{"id":"31.5.8","doc":"T","title":"Error Code Capture","words":427,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The Error Code Capture (ECC) feature allows the "},{"t":"block","v":"TWAI","id":"twai"},{"t":"text","v":" controller to record the error type and bit position of a TWAI bus error in the form of an error code."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Upon detecting a TWAI bus error, the Bus Error Interrupt is triggered and the error code is recorded in the "},{"t":"reg","v":"TWAI_ERR_CODE_CAP_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Subsequent bus errors will trigger the Bus Error Interrupt, but their error codes will not be recorded until the current error code is read from the "},{"t":"reg","v":"TWAI_ERR_CODE_CAP_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 31.5-11. Bit Information of TWAI_ERR_CODE_CAP_REG (0x30)","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Bit 31-8"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit 7"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit 6"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit 5"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit 4"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit 3"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit 2"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit 1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Bit 0"}]],"rows":[{"n":4,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Reserved"}],[{"t":"text","v":"ERRC.1 (1)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"ERRC.0 (1)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"DIR (2)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"SEG.4 (3)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"SEG.3 (3)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"SEG.2 (3)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"SEG.1 (3)"}],[{"t":"text","v":"SEG.0 (3)"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Notes:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ERRC: The Error Code (ERRC) indicates the type of bus error: 00 for bit error, 01 for format error, 10 for stuff error, 11 for other types of error."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"DIR: The Direction (DIR) indicates whether the TWAI controller was transmitting or receiving when the bus error occurred: 0 for transmitter, 1 for receiver."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"SEG: The Error Segment (SEG) 